#, fuzzy
msgid "Tree-shaking JAR dependencies"
msgstr "树状 JAR 依赖关系"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This feature is experimental and subject to change. Please provide feedback "
"if you encounter issues."
msgstr "此功能为试验性功能，可能会有更改。如果遇到问题，请提供反馈。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tree-shaking analyzes your application's bytecode at build time to determine "
"which classes from runtime dependencies are actually reachable.\n"
"Unreachable classes are excluded from the produced JAR, reducing its size."
msgstr ""
"树状结构会在构建时分析应用程序的字节码，以确定哪些运行时依赖关系中的类实际上是可以访问的。无法访问的类将从生成的 JAR 中排除，从而减小其大小。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This applies to `fast-jar`, `uber-jar`, `legacy-jar`, and `aot-jar` package "
"types."
msgstr "这适用于 `fast-jar` 、 `uber-jar` 、 `legacy-jar` 和 `aot-jar` 软件包类型。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Enabling tree-shaking"
msgstr "启用树形摇动"

