"To enable it, add the following property to your `application.properties`:"
msgstr "树形晃动默认为禁用。要启用它，请在 `应用程序` 的 properties 中添加以下属性："

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To explicitly disable it (if it was enabled elsewhere, e.g., in a parent "
"profile):"
msgstr "明确禁用它（如果它已在其他地方启用，例如在父配置文件中）："

