#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When tree-shaking is enabled, Quarkus determines which dependency classes "
"are actually reachable and excludes the rest from the final JAR.\n"
"The algorithm runs in several stages:"
msgstr "启用 \"树状抖动 \"后，Quarkus 会确定哪些依赖类实际上是可以访问的，并将其余依赖类排除在最终 JAR 之外。该算法分几个阶段运行："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Root collection"
msgstr "树根采集"

msgid ""
"The analysis starts by collecting root classes — classes that must be "
"preserved regardless of bytecode references.\n"
"Roots include the application main class, all generated classes, classes "
"registered for reflection or JNI access (by extensions or in `reflect-config."
"json` and `jni-config.json` files under `META-INF/native-image`), and "
"service provider implementations."
msgstr ""

msgid "Building a native executable adds more roots, see <<native-builds>>."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "BFS reachability"
msgstr "BFS 可及性"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting from roots, a breadth-first search walks bytecode references to "
"discover all reachable dependency classes.\n"
"The BFS recognizes the following patterns:"
msgstr "从根开始，广度优先搜索会遍历字节码引用，以发现所有可到达的依赖类。BFS 可识别以下模式："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Direct class references"
msgstr "直接引用类"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Superclasses, implemented interfaces, field types, method parameter and "
"return types, and exception types in `throws` clauses."
msgstr "超类、实现的接口、字段类型、方法参数和返回类型，以及 `抛出` 子句中的异常类型。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Annotations and generics"
msgstr "注解和泛型"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Class references appearing in annotation values and generic type signatures."
msgstr "注释值和通用类型签名中出现的类引用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "ServiceLoader / SPI"
msgstr "服务加载器 / SPI"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`ServiceLoader.load()` calls where the service interface is a compile-time "
"constant, and implementations listed in `META-INF/services` files."
msgstr ""
"服务接口是编译时常量的 `ServiceLoader.load()` 调用，以及 `META-INF/services` 文件中列出的实现。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Dynamic class loading"
msgstr "动态类加载"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`Class.forName()`, `ClassLoader.loadClass()`, and `MethodHandles.Lookup."
"findClass()` calls where the class name is a string constant in the bytecode."
" For cases where class names are constructed at runtime (e.g., via "
"`StringBuilder` or `invokedynamic` string concatenation), the tree-shaker "
"traces the call chain up to the class whose constructor or static "
"initializer triggers the loading, then executes it in a forked JVM with an "
"isolated class loader to dynamically capture which classes are loaded. This "
"handles libraries like BouncyCastle that build class names from package "
"prefixes and algorithm name arrays."
msgstr ""
"`Class.forName()` 、 `ClassLoader.loadClass(` ) 和 `MethodHandles.Lookup."
"findClass()` 调用，其中类名是字节码中的字符串常量。对于在运行时构造类名（例如通过 `StringBuilder` 或 `调用动态` "
"字符串连接）的情况，震树者会跟踪调用链，直到构造器或静态初始化器触发加载的类，然后在带有隔离类加载器的分叉 JVM "
"中执行，以动态捕获加载的类。这样就能处理像 BouncyCastle 这样根据包前缀和算法名称数组构建类名的库。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Reflection, JNI, and service provider registrations"
msgstr "反射、JNI 和服务提供商注册"

msgid ""
"Classes registered by extensions for reflection (`ReflectiveClassBuildItem`, "
"`ReflectiveFieldBuildItem`, `ReflectiveMethodBuildItem`), JNI runtime access "
"(`JniRuntimeAccessBuildItem`, `JniRuntimeAccessFieldBuildItem`, "
"`JniRuntimeAccessMethodBuildItem`), and service providers "
"(`ServiceProviderBuildItem`) are treated as root classes, see <<root-"
"collection>>. Weak reflective registrations are excluded — they are only "
"preserved if bytecode analysis independently reaches them. Conditional "
"registrations (`ReflectiveClassConditionBuildItem`) are evaluated to a fixed "
"point: a conditionally registered class becomes a root only when its "
"condition type is reachable."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "String constants"
msgstr "字符串常量"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When a method contains a string constant that exactly matches a fully-"
"qualified dependency class name, that class is marked reachable. Comma- or "
"colon-delimited lists of class names (as used by some frameworks) are also "
"handled by splitting and matching each part."
msgstr ""
"当方法中包含的字符串常量与完全限定的依赖类名称完全匹配时，该类就会被标记为可访问。以逗号或冒号分隔的类名列表（如某些框架所使用的）也可通过分割和匹配每个部分来处理。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Inner and outer classes"
msgstr "内班和外班"

#, fuzzy
msgid "If an outer class is reachable, its inner classes are preserved."
msgstr "如果外层类是可到达的，则其内层类将被保留。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Multi-release JAR entries"
msgstr "多版本 JAR 条目"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`META-INF/versions/N/` entries are analyzed, picking the highest version "
"compatible with the application's target Java version. Entries targeting "
"newer Java versions are also preserved when they are referenced by reachable "
"higher-version code, ensuring the JAR works correctly when run on a newer "
"JVM (e.g., native image built with Mandrel 25 while the app was compiled "
"with JDK 21)."
msgstr ""
"分析 `META-INF/versions/N/ 条目` 时，会选择与应用程序目标 Java 版本兼容的最高版本。当目标 Java "
"版本较新的条目被可达到的较高版本代码引用时，这些条目也会被保留，以确保 JAR 在较新的 JVM 上运行时能正常工作（例如，使用 Mandrel 25 "
"构建的本地映像，而应用程序是使用 JDK 21 编译的）。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "JBoss Logging companions"
msgstr "JBoss 日志同伴"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_$logger` and `_$bundle` companion classes are automatically included when "
"their owning class is reachable."
msgstr "`_$logger_` _和_ $bundle 伴生类可在其所属类可及时自动包含在内。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Sisu named components"
msgstr "Sisu 命名组件"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Classes discovered through Eclipse Sisu's named component loading are "
"preserved."
msgstr "通过 Eclipse Sisu 命名组件加载发现的类将被保留。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Class-loading chain analysis"
msgstr "分级装载链分析"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some libraries construct class names at runtime — for example, by "
"concatenating a package prefix with an algorithm name via `StringBuilder` or "
"`invokedynamic` — and load them via `ClassLoader.loadClass()` during static "
"initialization.\n"
"Because the class name strings are computed dynamically, the BFS over "
"bytecode references cannot trace them."
msgstr ""
"有些库在运行时构建类名，例如通过 `StringBuilder` 或 `invokedynamic` 将包前缀与算法名连接起来，并在静态初始化时通过 "
"`ClassLoader.loadClass() 加载` 它们。由于类名字符串是动态计算的，因此字节码引用的 BFS 无法跟踪它们。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To handle this, the tree-shaker runs a class-loading chain analysis after "
"the BFS:"
msgstr "为了解决这个问题，树形图生成器会在 BFS 之后运行类负载链分析："

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Seed propagation**: Builds a reverse caller index (callee to callers) "
"during the BFS bytecode scan and identifies methods that transitively call "
"`ClassLoader.loadClass(String)`, `Class.forName(String)`, or `MethodHandles."
"Lookup.findClass(String)` using an efficient worklist algorithm. The caller "
"index is extended incrementally across iterations."
msgstr ""
"*种子传播* ：在 BFS 字节码扫描过程中建立反向调用者索引（从调用者到被调用者），并使用高效的工作列表算法识别出临时调用 `ClassLoader."
"loadClass(String)` 、 `Class.` `forName` `(String)` 或 `MethodHandles.Lookup."
"findClass(String)` 的方法。调用者索引会在迭代中逐步扩展。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Entry point discovery**: Walks up the caller chain to find classes whose "
"constructor (`<init>`) or static initializer (`<clinit>`) triggers the class-"
"loading chain."
msgstr "*发现入口点* ：沿着调用者链查找构造函数 `（<init>）` 或静态初始化器 `（<clinit>）` 会触发类加载链的类。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Dynamic execution**: Each entry point class is executed in a forked JVM "
"process with an isolated `RecordingClassLoader` that captures every class "
"load attempt — including failed attempts. After instantiation, if the object "
"is a `Map` (e.g., a JCA security provider), its values are also inspected "
"for class name strings that are stored for deferred loading. Running in a "
"separate process ensures complete isolation of global JVM state and is safe "
"for parallel Maven builds (`-T2C`)."
msgstr ""
"*动态执行* ：每个入口点类都在一个分叉的 JVM 进程中执行，该进程带有一个独立的 `RecordingClassLoader` "
"，可捕获每次类加载尝试，包括失败的尝试。实例化后，如果对象是 `Map` （如 JCA "
"安全提供者），还将检查其值是否包含类名字符串，并将其存储起来以备延迟加载。在单独的进程中运行可确保完全隔离全局 JVM 状态，并可安全地进行并行 "
"Maven 构建 `(-T2C` )。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The chain analysis runs in an incremental fixed-point loop: the reverse "
"caller index is extended as new classes are discovered. Only new entry "
"points are executed in each iteration, avoiding redundant work. The loop "
"terminates when no new classes are found."
msgstr ""
"链分析以增量定点循环的方式运行：当发现新的类时，反向调用者索引就会扩展。每次迭代只执行新的入口点，避免重复工作。当没有发现新的类时，循环终止。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, BouncyCastle's `BouncyCastleProvider` constructor calls "
"`setup()` which calls `loadAlgorithms()` which calls `loadServiceClass()` "
"which calls `ClassUtil.loadClass()`.\n"
"The tree-shaker identifies `BouncyCastleProvider` as the entry point, "
"instantiates it in the recording class loader, and captures all dynamically "
"loaded algorithm classes."
msgstr ""
"例如，BouncyCastle 的 `BouncyCastleProvider` 构造函数调用 `setup()` ，然后调用 "
"`loadAlgorithms()` ，再调用 `loadServiceClass(` `)，最后调用 ClassUtil.loadClass()` "
"。树形结构器将 `BouncyCastleProvider` 识别为入口点，将其实例化到记录类加载器中，并捕获所有动态加载的算法类。"

msgid "Module-level tree-shaking"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When a Quarkus modular packaging extension is present (for example, `quarkus-"
"jlink`), tree-shaking also operates at the module level.\n"
"After the class-level analysis determines which classes are reachable, the "
"module tree-shaker evaluates each module in the application's module model:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A module is *class-dead* if it contains `.class` entries but none of them "
"are in the reachable set. Class-dead modules are removed entirely from the "
"packaged application."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A module with no `.class` entries at all (a resource-only JAR) is kept alive "
"— it may provide configuration files, native libraries, or other resources "
"needed at runtime."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A module with an empty content tree (no content to contribute) is treated as "
"dead."
msgstr ""

msgid "After dead modules are removed, surviving modules are cleaned up:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`requires` directives pointing to removed modules are dropped."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Auto-dependency groups whose entries all point to removed modules are "
"dropped."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Service provider entries (`provides ... with ...`) whose implementation "
"classes are not in the reachable set are removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Unreachable classes are removed from the module, while non-class resources "
"(for example, resource bundles) are always kept.\n"
"Packages left with no content are removed from the module descriptor, "
"together with any `add-exports` or `add-opens` of those packages declared by "
"other modules."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The set of JDK modules required by the application is recomputed from "
"surviving modules only, which can reduce the size of a `jlink` image."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The module tree-shaker also performs a graph reachability analysis — a BFS "
"from root modules (the application module and boot modules) through the "
"dependency graph.\n"
"Modules that are not reachable from any root but still contain reachable "
"classes are *not* removed, since they may be accessed via reflection, "
"service loading, or from automatic modules without explicit `requires` "
"directives.\n"
"A warning is logged for such modules to help diagnose missing dependency "
"declarations."
msgstr ""

msgid "Native builds"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When tree-shaking is enabled for a native build, it applies to the JARs "
"passed to `native-image`, including those produced with `quarkus.native."
"sources-only=true`.\n"
"`native-image` performs its own reachability analysis and only includes "
"reachable code in the executable, so tree-shaking the JARs is not expected "
"to make the native executable smaller."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In addition to the <<root-collection,roots of all builds>>, the tree-shaker "
"keeps the following classes when building a native executable:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"GraalVM Features: `--features` arguments in `native-image.properties` files "
"and Features registered by extensions. `native-image` loads them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Classes named in class initialization settings: `--initialize-at-run-time` "
"and `--initialize-at-build-time` arguments in `native-image.properties` "
"files, and runtime-initialized classes registered by extensions.\n"
"These settings don't make `native-image` include a class, but the tree-"
"shaker currently keeps the classes they name."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Security providers registered by extensions, which `native-image` fails to "
"build without."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Classes referenced by classes that extensions generate only for `native-"
"image`, such as generated GraalVM Features."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Classes referenced by predefined classes, i.e. classes defined at runtime "
"from bytecode listed in `predefined-classes-config.json`."
msgstr ""

msgid "GraalVM substitutions, as described below."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"These roots are not considered for JVM builds, so a JVM build may remove "
"classes that a native build of the same application keeps."
msgstr ""

msgid "GraalVM substitutions"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`native-image` discovers substitution classes (`@TargetClass`), in "
"dependencies or in the application, by scanning the class path, and fails if "
"a substitution's target class is missing.\n"
"So a substitution class is kept when its target class is kept, and its "
"target class is kept when the substitution class is kept:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A substitution whose target is always present (a JDK or GraalVM class, an "
"application class, or a class of an artifact excluded from tree-shaking) is "
"always kept."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A substitution whose target is not on the class path at all is removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Substitutions whose target is computed by a `classNameProvider`, and other "
"classes using GraalVM substitution annotations, are always kept."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a target given as an `innerClass`, `native-image` looks it up among the "
"declared classes of the enclosing classes.\n"
"So when such a substitution is kept, the enclosing classes and all their "
"member classes are kept loadable: together with their superclasses and "
"interfaces, but without the classes only their code references."
msgstr ""

